{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01296","headline":"相和歌辞 怨歌行 · 虞世南","name":"相和歌辞 怨歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫殿秋风冷，雕甍白日沈。\n裁纨凄断曲，织素别离心。\n掖庭羞改画，长门不惜金。\n宠移恩稍薄，情疎恨转深。\n香销翠羽帐，弦断凤皇琴。\n镜前红粉歇，阶上绿苔侵。\n谁言掩歌扇，飜作白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}